@Vaer I was irritated enough that I went to XWord Info and discovered that OCHRE has been used 58 times in the modern era, while OCHER has been used 51 times.

At least the editors have settled on TSAR referring to the Russian despot, and CZAR referring to the head of a federal task force or similar role.

On a happier note, the crossword has returned to its proper place at the top of the app, for which I'm inordinately grateful (little victories mean a lot these days).

